    "This permanently removes every conversation, word and progress record on this iPhone. It cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This permanently removes every conversation, word and progress record on this iPhone. It cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina definitivamente todas las conversaciones, palabras y registros de progreso de este iPhone. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime définitivement toutes les conversations, tous les mots et toute progression sur cet iPhone. C'est irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes conversations, vocabulary and progress. Export a backup first if you want to keep them. Your API key and preferences remain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes conversations, vocabulary and progress. Export a backup first if you want to keep them. Your API key and preferences remain."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina conversaciones, vocabulario y progreso. Exporta antes una copia de seguridad si quieres conservarlos. Tu clave API y tus preferencias se conservan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime les conversations, le vocabulaire et la progression. Exporte d'abord une sauvegarde si tu veux les garder. Ta clé API et tes préférences restent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the %@ conversations, words and lesson progress. Other languages, your key and your preferences remain. Export a backup first if you want to keep them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes the %@ conversations, words and lesson progress. Other languages, your key and your preferences remain. Export a backup first if you want to keep them."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina las conversaciones, las palabras y el progreso de lecciones de %1$@. Los demás idiomas, tu clave y tus preferencias se conservan. Exporta antes una copia de seguridad si quieres conservarlos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime les conversations, les mots et la progression des leçons en %1$@. Les autres langues, ta clé et tes préférences restent. Exporte d'abord une sauvegarde si tu veux les garder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes your sign-in details and account sessions and forfeits any unused free minutes. Learning history stays on this iPhone; you can remove it separately in Settings. A paid balance, pending payment or active conversation must be resolved before deletion.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This removes your sign-in details and account sessions and forfeits any unused free minutes. Learning history stays on this iPhone; you can remove it separately in Settings. A paid balance, pending payment or active conversation must be resolved before deletion."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto elimina tus datos de acceso y las sesiones de la cuenta, y pierdes los minutos gratuitos sin usar. El historial de aprendizaje se queda en este iPhone; puedes eliminarlo aparte en Ajustes. Un saldo pagado, un pago pendiente o una conversación activa deben resolverse antes de eliminar la cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime tes identifiants de connexion et tes sessions de compte, et tu perds les minutes gratuites non utilisées. L'historique d'apprentissage reste sur cet iPhone ; tu peux le supprimer séparément dans les Réglages. Un solde payé, un paiement en attente ou une conversation active doit être réglé avant la suppression."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This saved exam couldn’t be opened. Its original data has not been changed.": {
